<div class="Section1">
<h1>Phase 5: Project Development Phase</h1>
<p style="font-size: 13pt; color: #4a5568;"><strong>ContentGen (BlogNest) Codebase &amp; Architecture</strong></p>

<h2>1. Project Setup (Epic 2)</h2>
<p>Developed under folder <code>Server/</code>:</p>
<pre><code>Server/
├── package.json
├── .env
├── server.js
├── app.js
├── seeder.js
├── config/db.js
├── models/ (userModel, postModel, commentModel, categoryModel, mediaModel)
├── middlewares/ (authMiddleware, errorMiddleware, validationMiddleware)
├── services/geminiService.js
├── controllers/ (auth, post, comment, category, media, ai, user)
└── routes/ (auth, post, comment, category, media, ai, user)</code></pre>

<h2>2. Backend Development (Epic 3)</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>server.js:</strong> Process signal handling, uncaught exceptions, and port listener on Port 5000.</li>
  <li><strong>app.js:</strong> Express middleware pipeline (Helmet, CORS, Morgan, express.json, rate limiting, centralized error handling).</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Database Configuration (Epic 4)</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>config/db.js:</strong> Mongoose connection with event listeners and automatic reconnection hooks.</li>
  <li><strong>userModel.js:</strong> Pre-save bcrypt hashing (10 salt rounds) and JWT token generation method.</li>
  <li><strong>postModel.js:</strong> Schema with title (name), content body (message), photo, likes, views, status, and compound text search index.</li>
  <li><strong>commentModel.js:</strong> Post and user references with moderation flags (approved, pending, spam).</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Google Gemini AI Flow Integration</h2>
<ul>
  <li><code>services/geminiService.js</code> connects to Google Gemini 1.5 Flash using <code>@google/generative-ai</code>.</li>
  <li>Supports blog generation, summarization, FAQs, WeatherWise insights, and FitTrack recommendations.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</body>
